    narr:narration """This position holds that [day-old loaves drop to half price at two in the afternoon, not at close](narr:Expr_20261009_2_Batch2Bakery20261009041528_hd461484810ba_1), with the reasoning that at close nobody is left to buy them. [The shelf card changes at two as well](narr:Expr_20261009_2_Batch2Bakery20261009041528_hd461484810ba_2), so the price is never a surprise at the till. Both members, dated the same day, align on the two-o'clock mark: one supplies the pricing rationale, the other the card-update coordination.""" ;
